+    /// <summary>The shortest mark that is an element, in dits.</summary>
+    /// <remarks>
+    /// **FLDIGI'S SPIKE RULE, TAKEN AT ITS OWN RATIO** (work instruction 462,
+    /// HM-REQ-129): `cw_noise_spike_threshold = cw_receive_dot_length / 2`, and a
